        "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
        "Label": "IMPLICATIONS FOR REHABILITATION",
        "content": "Six-minute walking test. The six-minute walking test is safe and widely performed in the world because of its easy implementation and low cost. Many countries have established normal values to the six-minute walking test in healthy children. However, the applicability of this test also gains popularity among children with other disease conditions."
